        'FAQ content written around real customer and distributor questions',
      ],
      imageAlt: 'Kenya flag and coastal landscape representing Dynapharm Kenya coverage',
    },
    faqHeading: 'Frequently Asked Questions - Dynapharm Kenya',
    faq: [
      { q: 'Where is Dynapharm Kenya located?', a: 'Dynapharm Kenya has listed DPC locations in Nairobi CBD, Thika, Murang\'a, Mombasa, Kitale, Nakuru, Nyeri, Ruiru, Buruburu, Kitengela, Eldoret, Kisumu, Voi and Kasarani.' },
      { q: 'How many Dynapharm Kenya DPC locations are listed?', a: 'This country profile lists 18 Kenya DPC locations after removing the internal DPC codes supplied in the source list.' },
      { q: 'Is there a Dynapharm location in Nairobi CBD?', a: 'Yes. Nairobi CBD entries include Hazina Towers, Sanlam, Norwich and Accra, with additional Nairobi-area coverage in Buruburu and Kasarani.' },
      { q: 'Is Dynapharm available in Mombasa?', a: 'Yes. The Kenya list includes Mombasa and Mombasa Qamar Plaza, supporting customers and distributors around the coastal port city.' },
      { q: 'Which Central Kenya towns are listed?', a: 'Central Kenya and Mount Kenya corridor locations include Thika, Ruiru, Murang\'a and Nyeri.' },
      { q: 'Which western and Rift Valley locations are listed?', a: 'The listed locations include Nakuru, Eldoret, Kisumu and Kitale, supporting Rift Valley, Lake Victoria and North Rift search coverage.' },
      { q: 'Can I become a Dynapharm distributor in Kenya?', a: 'Yes. Visit or contact the nearest Kenya DPC location for distributor registration guidance, product education and business opportunity support.' },
